+{
+  "exit": 0,
+  "files": {
+    "README.md": "# analytics-stream\n\nReal-time analytics event processing pipeline\n\n## Ownership\n\n| Field | Value |\n| ----- | ----- |\n| Team | data |\n| Escalation | data-services |\n| PagerDuty | data-services |\n\n## Architecture\n\n| Property | Value |\n| -------- | ----- |\n| Tier | high |\n| Type | stream |\n| Support Model | self |\n| Dependencies | 2 |\n\n## SLOs\n\n| Name | Target | Window | Type |\n| ---- | ------ | ------ | ---- |\n| processing-availability | 99.5 | 30d | availability |\n| stream-lag | 99.0 | 30d | availability |\n| event-latency-p99 | 95.0 | 30d | latency |\n\n## Dependencies\n\n| Name | Type | Critical | SLO Availability |\n| ---- | ---- | -------- | ---------------- |\n| analytics_db | database | No | - |\n| stream_cache | database | No | - |\n\n## Deployment\n\nNo deployment configuration defined.\n\n## APIs\n\n<!-- TODO: Add API endpoint documentation -->\n\n## Runbook\n\n<!-- TODO: Add runbook link -->\n",
+    "adr/001-initial-architecture.md": "# ADR-001: Initial Architecture for analytics-stream\n\n## Status\n\nAccepted\n\n## Context\n\nanalytics-stream is a **high**-tier **stream** service owned by the **data** team.\nIt depends on: analytics_db, stream_cache.\n\n## Decision\n\n- **Tier:** high — standard reliability requirements\n- **SLO targets:**\n  - processing-availability: 99.5 (30d window)\n  - stream-lag: 99.0 (30d window)\n  - event-latency-p99: 95.0 (30d window)\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Service must maintain SLO targets as defined above\n- Deployment gates enforce error budget thresholds before release\n- On-call rotation required for this tier level\n",
+    "adr/README.md": "# Architecture Decision Records — analytics-stream\n\nThis directory contains architecture decision records (ADRs) for the analytics-stream service.\n\n## Index\n\n| ID | Title | Status |\n| -- | ----- | ------ |\n| 001 | [Initial Architecture](001-initial-architecture.md) | Accepted |\n\n## Creating a New ADR\n\nCopy `template.md` and increment the ID number.\n",
+    "adr/template.md": "# ADR-NNN: Title\n\n## Status\n\nProposed\n\n## Context\n\nWhat is the issue that we're seeing that is motivating this decision or change?\n\n## Decision\n\nWhat is the change that we're proposing and/or doing?\n\n## Consequences\n\nWhat becomes easier or more difficult to do because of this change?\n",
+    "api.md": "# Event Documentation — analytics-stream\n\n## Events\n\n<!-- TODO: Document event schemas -->\n\n### Example Event\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"example.event\",\n  \"data\": {}\n}\n```\n\n## SLO Expectations\n\n- **processing-availability:** 99.5 (30d window)\n- **stream-lag:** 99.0 (30d window)\n- **event-latency-p99:** 95.0 (30d window)\n"
+  }
+}
